WEBVTT

00:02:29.833 --> 00:02:31.101
EP: So it's interesting.

00:02:31.125 --> 00:02:33.601
I don't experience
myself as transitioning.

00:02:33.625 --> 00:02:38.018
I, as a therapist, have worked for years
with people who have work issues

00:02:38.042 --> 00:02:39.851
and certainly with family businesses.

00:02:39.875 --> 00:02:43.184
So it's just that the podcast
has transitioned.

00:02:43.208 --> 00:02:46.518
However, I look at relational systems,

00:02:46.542 --> 00:02:49.726
and relationships exist within a context,

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:52.601
a cultural, political,
socioeconomic context.

00:02:52.625 --> 00:02:54.601
Relationships have expectations.

00:02:54.625 --> 00:02:57.809
All relationships do.
All relationships have boundaries.

00:02:57.833 --> 00:03:00.768
All relationships, if they are strong,